BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Glass Art Society x REFRACT Film Festival
DTSTART:20261017T190000Z
DTEND:20261017T215500Z
DTSTAMP:20261017T190000Z
UID:BAjAdlhoSQ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 160 mins (2h40m)\n\nPresented by Glass Art Society a
 nd REFRACT. Enjoy the intersection of glass and film and watch the Glass 
 Art Society Annual Film Festival (2026)! The following short films will be
  shown as follows:Speculum Vogue\, directed by Emma MitchisonTouching the 
 Light\, directed by Cary RapaportChime: An Extended View\, directed by Jan
 etje Jeanine VerloopDead Horse Bay\, directed by Zachary FinkelsteinPlay w
 ith Materials\, directed by Daichi FuwaI\, Phoenix\, directed by Simone Fe
 zerTouches as from Inside\, directed by Ina Kristine HoveBlowing in a New 
 Era\, directed by Charlie Reid McGowanInvocation\, directed by Caitlin Gre
 enberg Elena Lee\, Pioneer Gallerist\, directed by Danièle Bellemare Lee
 In partnership with the Glass Art Society and REFRACT all ticket proceeds 
 will go to support SIFF\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/glass-a
 rt-society-x-refract-film-festival\n\nEstimated start: 12:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
