BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:La bola negra
DTSTART:20261112T000000Z
DTEND:20261112T025500Z
DTSTAMP:20261112T000000Z
UID:pAX3CCCg0X
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 159 mins (2h39m)\n\nLa bola negra\, also known as Th
 e Black Ball\, inspired by an unfinished play by Federico García Lorca\, 
 will be a queer vindication about three men in three different moments of 
 Spanish history: 1932\, 1937\, and 2017.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in
 -theaters/la-bola-negra\n\nEstimated start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
